					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Well, I have been reading up on my epic and I think it is about time I get some items that I need.  The first part of the epic requires me running around Norrath, so with PoP and Selo's that should be easy enough.  I am gonna need a red scale and white scale, I am comming close to getting the Red Scale off of Naggy, I think there are three ahead of me for that, the white scale drops of off Lady Vox, that will be the next Raid I join after I get the scale from Naggy.<br />
<br />
I figure on Sundays, I will work on the parts that I need for the Epic (besides Naggy and Vox raids).  I am also gonna have to visit KK and kill Phinny, I know that Wizzys, need an item or the same item I need off of him.  I think this is something we can do as a guild, for myself and anyone else that needs it.  I think I will go on a public raid in KK when I get the time just to get a better picture of what needs to get done.<br />
<br />
I am asking for is this:<br />
<br />
I will scope out area's that I might need help with, then talk to Kloude and set up a raid to help me get Items that i need.  I will not ask the guild to help me until I know exactly what has to get done and what precautions are needed.  <br />
<br />
Also, does anyone know if you have to do things in order to get the epic or can you do little pieces at a time?<br />
<br />
I think you can do items in any order, just as long as you have all the components needed for the final turn in. Am I correct with that?<br />
<br />
Just wondering,<br />
Kitty<br />
<br />
P.S. Anyone know where Loron has been, I have not seem him in quite sometime?						</td>
